        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jennifer Paige Chambers, Nathan Lane, Matthew Broderick, Martin Short, Jason Alexander, Louis Stadlen, Don Stephenson\n- Roles: musical theatre performer\n- Productions: The Producers, Broadway, Los Angeles production, National Tour\n- Works: Jungle 2 Jungle, Jiminy Glick, Ed Grimley\n\nFacts:\n- Jennifer Paige Chambers is a musical theatre performer.\n- Jennifer Paige Chambers appeared in \"The Producers\" on Broadway with Nathan Lane and Matthew Broderick.\n- Jennifer Paige Chambers appeared in \"The Producers\" in Los Angeles with Martin Short and Jason Alexander.\n- Jennifer Paige Chambers appeared in the National Tour of \"The Producers\" with Louis Stadlen and Don Stephenson.\n- Martin Short created the characters Jiminy Glick and Ed Grimley.\n- Martin Short was associated with \"Jungle 2 Jungle\" in 1997.",
